adolescente | teenager | Cuando era adolescente, vivía en Bogotá. | family | 3 | When I was a teenager, I lived in Bogotá.
joven | young; young person | Mi tía es muy joven. | family | 2 | My aunt is very young.
rubio | blond; fair-haired | Mi hermano es rubio y alto. | family | 2 | My brother is blond and tall.
moreno | dark-haired; dark-skinned; tanned | Mi padre es moreno y tiene barba. | family | 2 | My father has dark hair and a beard.
