barba | beard | Mi abuelo tiene una barba blanca. | family | 2 | My grandfather has a white beard.
gracioso | funny | Mi primo es muy gracioso. | family | 2 | My cousin is very funny.
serio | serious | El profesor de historia es muy serio. | family | 2 | The history teacher is very serious.
inteligente | intelligent; smart; clever | Mi hermana es muy inteligente. | family | 2 | My sister is very smart.
cariñoso | affectionate; loving | Mi perro es muy cariñoso. | family | 3 | My dog is very affectionate.
perezoso | lazy | Mi gato es muy perezoso. | family | 3 | My cat is very lazy.
