archivo | file | Te mando el archivo por correo. | technology | 3 | I'll send you the file by email.
guardar | to save; to keep | No olvides guardar el documento. | technology | 2 | Don't forget to save the document.
borrar | to delete; to erase | ¿Puedes borrar esa foto, por favor? | technology | 2 | Can you delete that photo, please?
imprimir | to print | Tengo que imprimir los boletos. | technology | 3 | I have to print the tickets.
